flowchart TB
accTitle: Keep TLS keys inside the HSM and authorize log reads separately
accDescr: TCP traffic reaches web servers, which invoke HSM key operations without key export; reading logs requires S3 and KMS permissions.
C[TLS client] --> N[NLB TCP listener]
N --> W[Web servers across AZs]
W -->|Private-key operation| H[CloudHSM across AZs - non-extractable key]
H -->|Operation result only| W
W -->|Application logs| S[(S3 with SSE-KMS)]
E[Employee request] --> P{S3 read allowed?}
P -->|Yes| K{KMS decrypt allowed?}
K -->|Yes| S
P -->|No| X[Denied]
K -->|No| X
class C,E inputData
class P,K decision
class H,S storage
class X warning
